{"person":"person:canon:qiaofeng","as_name":"乔装的汉子","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:tongbaishan","believed_by":["person:canon:moyunzi","person:canon:zhuifengzi","person:canon:chuchenzi"],"ch":[25,25],"b":"text","ev":[[25,25,28,36,"90e6770f50572245"],[25,86,147,167,"861baab78f9c111f"]],"tag":"text","note":"回溯：萧峰此前在桐柏山助包不同对阵星宿门人时是乔装的；本回他不再乔装，摩云子与追风子等人见面时认不出，直到后来才认出他"}
{"person":"person:canon:azi","as_name":"大师姊","kind":"title","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["*"],"ch":[25,25],"b":"text","ev":[[25,213,75,83,"6143acd16feefd27"],[25,222,68,75,"b12601a713a0121a"]],"tag":"text","note":"阿紫借萧峰暗中相助击败大师兄，众星宿门人从此奉她为大师姊；她自称这身份是蒙混得来的，众人并不知情"}
{"person":"person:canon:zhaixingzi","as_name":"大师兄","kind":"title","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["*"],"ch":[25,25],"b":"text","ev":[[25,141,161,176,"1523beae55358ddd"],[25,190,34,45,"fd94e0c2370df093"]],"tag":"text","note":"星宿派以武功强弱排行，摘星子年纪轻轻而居首位，门人称他大师兄，直到本回被阿紫击败改口称其为败类"}
